WEBVTT

00:11:29.325 --> 00:11:33.939
In Thai language,
when you commit to do something,

00:11:33.963 --> 00:11:37.096
you put tangjai in front of your word,

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:41.085
so your heart will be in your action.

00:11:42.023 --> 00:11:44.223
No matter how rough the path,

00:11:44.247 --> 00:11:46.230
how big the crack,

00:11:46.254 --> 00:11:48.119
you push through to your goal,

00:11:48.143 --> 00:11:50.637
because that's where your heart is.

00:11:52.720 --> 00:11:55.537
And yes, Thailand is home.

00:11:58.107 --> 00:12:00.180
This land is my only home,